1
00:00:00,333 --> 00:00:02,848
Hi, I'm Anna. I designed Evergreen.

2
00:00:02,898 --> 00:00:05,793
I want to improve my fitness in a sustainable manner,

3
00:00:05,843 --> 00:00:10,449
but my ideal workout plan goes out the window the moment it meets the real world.

4
00:00:10,499 --> 00:00:13,489
A meeting runs late, it rains, your shoes wear out,

5
00:00:13,539 --> 00:00:17,290
you overtrain and tear your meniscus three times (that's a true story),

6
00:00:17,340 --> 00:00:21,280
and before you know it, you're on the couch watching TV instead of working out.

7
00:00:21,330 --> 00:00:25,081
Evergreen is a personal training agent that works with your real life.

8
00:00:25,131 --> 00:00:28,188
It takes in all your data from Apple Health.

9
00:00:28,238 --> 00:00:31,133
Then it reads your calendar and finds the time you actually have.

10
00:00:31,183 --> 00:00:34,933
This week, we have workouts planned Friday, Saturday and Sunday.

11
00:00:34,983 --> 00:00:37,499
Evergreen built these out so I don't overtrain.

12
00:00:37,549 --> 00:00:39,687
Jonathan, show them what it does.

13
00:00:40,357 --> 00:00:43,253
Thanks, Anna. I'm Jonathan, and I built the iOS app.

14
00:00:43,303 --> 00:00:46,768
Evergreen doesn't just plan sustainable workouts based on your training load.

15
00:00:46,818 --> 00:00:50,094
It acts for you, end to end, to keep you on track.

16
00:00:50,144 --> 00:00:54,274
At 4 PM, a team sync lands right on top of tonight's 6 PM run.

17
00:00:54,324 --> 00:00:58,740
Nobody taps anything. The agent sees the conflict and moves the run to 6:45,

18
00:00:58,790 --> 00:01:02,065
your next open slot, so the week still has all three workouts.

19
00:01:02,115 --> 00:01:05,723
It tells you why it rescheduled, and lets you reschedule if necessary.

20
00:01:05,773 --> 00:01:09,429
Oh no! Rain is forecast for Saturday's 8:30 AM long run.

21
00:01:09,479 --> 00:01:13,989
Evergreen finds a $15 day pass at 24 Hour Fitness, close to home.

22
00:01:14,039 --> 00:01:17,362
One tap, and it books the pass and moves the run onto a treadmill.

23
00:01:17,412 --> 00:01:19,503
Surya, show them how it shops.

24
00:01:20,173 --> 00:01:25,444
Thanks, Jonathan. I'm Surya. I built the recommendation harness behind this app.

25
00:01:25,494 --> 00:01:31,335
Let's say Jordan's shoes are at 390 miles, 97% worn, and his race is in about nine days.

26
00:01:31,385 --> 00:01:35,221
The harness picks from real shoes found on expert review sites.

27
00:01:35,271 --> 00:01:43,639
Before any AI is involved, hard rules filter out shoes that don't fit, lack cushioning, or arrive too late.

28
00:01:43,689 --> 00:01:46,964
Then we have Superlinked's SIE, which ranks the shortlist,

29
00:01:47,014 --> 00:01:51,724
and a small open model picks one and explains why every other shoe lost.

30
00:01:51,774 --> 00:01:57,995
We use Senso, which supplies live, cited sources, so every claim on the screen has a source.

31
00:01:58,045 --> 00:02:05,216
It's $170, over his $20 rule, so it asks first, and every decision is logged to SingleStore.

32
00:02:05,266 --> 00:02:08,788
Persona here verifies your age for 18+ purchases.

33
00:02:08,838 --> 00:02:13,853
Jordan says yes once, and two break-in runs land on his calendar.

34
00:02:13,903 --> 00:02:15,490
Tony, take us home.

35
00:02:16,160 --> 00:02:22,286
Thanks, Surya. I'm Tony. I built Evergreen's memory agent and its Amplitude tracking.

36
00:02:22,336 --> 00:02:28,272
Amplitude tells us which workout suggestions people accept, which they complete,

37
00:02:28,322 --> 00:02:34,913
and when feedback becomes a saved preference, without sending names or raw health readings.

38
00:02:34,963 --> 00:02:40,519
On the phone, the agent turns workout history into a personal baseline.

39
00:02:40,569 --> 00:02:45,583
I used Superlinked to interpret sample feedback like “too early,”

40
00:02:45,633 --> 00:02:54,001
and built a calendar preview that uses those preferences to suggest workout times that fit.

41
00:02:54,051 --> 00:02:59,164
We are Anna, Jonathan, Surya and Tony. Thank you!

